{"id":"0cefcc7942834ee1","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength.md","title":"KF 与 VF 不具有相同算术后果","display":"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength — KF 与 VF 不具有相同算术后果","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength","aliases":["91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength","91-cor-KF-VF-strength","91-cor-VF-KF-equal"],"display":"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength — KF 与 VF 不具有相同算术后果","depends_on":["[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength</span><span>91-cor-KF-VF-strength</span><span>91-cor-VF-KF-equal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength — KF 与 VF 不具有相同算术后果"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d84df7f701355c56\" href=\"?note=d84df7f701355c56\" title=\"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence\">91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> 为原书版本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为算术后果比较。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}VF\\text{-}equivalent\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{KF}\\not\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}VF\\text{-}equivalent\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{KF}\\not\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>直接应用上游 KF 与迭代真理、VF 与最小正归纳定义的强度校准。相同经典外层逻辑或共享“固定点”动机不能推出算术等强。\n此处只保留实际推论，不重复定义 RT 与 ID<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_1\">\\(_1\\)</span>，亦不把层级长度写成两个理论均有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 的序数值。</p>\n<p>来源：§15.3、第 17 章末、第 18 章 及上游强度定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"d84df7f701355c56","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}KF\\text{-}VF\\text{-}equivalent\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{KF}\\not\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.","display":true},{"tex":"_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false}],"bytes":1193,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-200","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-200","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-KF-VF-equivalent-strength]]"}],"outgoing":["d84df7f701355c56"]}